[
 {
  "kind": 1,
  "language": "markdown",
  "value": "# Lab 6: The Campus Weather Panel\n\n**Goal:** Build a live dashboard for your weather station inside the Coreflux HUB.\n\n**What you will build:**\n- **`CampusWeather` (Panel):** A 4-column grid dashboard (`DEFINE PANEL`) with four live components:\n  1. **`TempGauge` (`gauge`):** Temperature in °C (`-20` to `45` °C) from `campus/weather/reading`.\n  2. **`TempF` (`value`):** Temperature in °F from `campus/weather/reading`.\n  3. **`Wind` (`value`):** Wind speed in km/h from `campus/weather/reading`.\n  4. **`HeatState` (`text`):** Heat alert state (`on` / `off`) from `campus/weather/alerts/heat_active`.\n\n> **Syntax tip:** Indent every `WITH` line 4 spaces under `DEFINE PANEL`, as shown below. Each component extracts its JSON field from `campus/weather/reading` using `WITH JSON_PATH \"…\"` on its `BIND` line."
 },
 {
  "kind": 2,
  "language": "lot",
  "value": "DEFINE PANEL CampusWeather\n    WITH VISIBILITY PUBLIC\n    WITH STATE PUBLISHED\n    WITH TITLE \"Campus Weather\"\n    WITH LAYOUT \"grid\" COLUMNS 4 ROWS 1\n\n    ADD COMPONENT \"TempGauge\" WITH TYPE \"gauge\"\n        AT COLUMN 1 ROW 1\n        SET LABEL \"Temperature\"\n        SET RANGE FROM -20 TO 45\n        SET UNIT \"°C\"\n        BIND VALUE TO TOPIC \"campus/weather/reading\" WITH JSON_PATH \"temperature_c\"\n\n    ADD COMPONENT \"TempF\" WITH TYPE \"value\"\n        AT COLUMN 2 ROW 1\n        SET LABEL \"Fahrenheit\"\n        SET UNIT \"°F\"\n        SET DECIMALS 1\n        BIND VALUE TO TOPIC \"campus/weather/reading\" WITH JSON_PATH \"temperature_f\"\n\n    ADD COMPONENT \"Wind\" WITH TYPE \"value\"\n        AT COLUMN 3 ROW 1\n        SET LABEL \"Wind\"\n        SET UNIT \"km/h\"\n        SET DECIMALS 1\n        BIND VALUE TO TOPIC \"campus/weather/reading\" WITH JSON_PATH \"wind_kmh\"\n\n    ADD COMPONENT \"HeatState\" WITH TYPE \"text\"\n        AT COLUMN 4 ROW 1\n        SET LABEL \"Heat alert\"\n        BIND CONTENT TO TOPIC \"campus/weather/alerts/heat_active\""
 },
 {
  "kind": 1,
  "language": "markdown",
  "value": "## Check It Worked\n\n1. Open **Dashboards** from the bottom dock — you will see **Campus Weather** in the list. Click it to open your dashboard.\n2. Components show `---` until the next reading arrives. Open **Data Viewer → Publish** and send `poll` to `campus/weather/request`.\n3. Watch all four components populate live with °C, °F, km/h, and `on`/`off`!\n\nDocs: [Defining panels](https://docs.coreflux.org/latest/lot-language/panels/defining-panels) · [Data binding](https://docs.coreflux.org/latest/lot-language/panels/data-binding)."
 }
]
